  Nodes:
  - NodeID: Start
    SpeakerName: Brother Hai (Pho Seller)
    Text: You won't believe it, the Village Elder just broke his own record. Seven
      crullers in one sitting!
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 1
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 1
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: No way. How is he even walking after that?
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 2
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 2
    SpeakerName: Brother Hai (Pho Seller)
    Text: "Honestly, I think he has a second stomach just for my ph\u1EDF. He just
      sat \r\nthere for an hour, looking like a happy balloon.\r\n"
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 3
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 3
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: Well, if I die, I want it to be from eating too many of your crullers too.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 4
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 4
    SpeakerName: Brother Hai (Pho Seller)
    Text: "Haha! I\u2019ll make sure to put an extra one in your bowl next time,
      bro."
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
